  (text "If = (24 V - 1.2 V opto - 2.0 V LED) / 4.4 k = 4.7 mA.  Each 2.2 k (1/4 W): 49 mW at 24 V, 75 mW at 28.8 V." (at 25.4 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2a4e6688-294f-5503-be1b-99cc20a4b7ef))
  (text "1N4148 protects both LEDs against a reversed input (PC817 VR max = 6 V)." (at 25.4 41.91 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 540aaca4-8d4e-5115-a38f-e8c87c5e8549))
